nding FND-0064.]\\n\\n- For ordered-to-unordered reduced-support constructions over possibly nonreduced bases, reduction must be applied compatibly: the canonical torsor is I to I^{red-supp}, and its reduced form is I_red to (I^{red-supp})_red; reducing only the source generally destroys flatness. [evidence: source; Packet finding FND-0087.]\\n\\n- A fibrewise equivalence between nonvanishing of a CE obstruction space and triviality of a degree-zero line bundle establishes equality only on geometric points; identifying relative evaluation-failure with an Abel\\u2013Jacobi incidence over an arbitrary base requires comparison of determinantal/Fitting scheme structures. [evidence: source; Packet finding FND-0046.]\\n\\n- Riemann\\u2013Roch chi(L)=1 for L=W_5 tensor omega_C^{-1} of degree 6 on a smooth genus-6 curve proves only that the full Abel\\u2013Jacobi fibre in Sym^6 is nonempty; it does not prove that the reduced-support open or the ordered Conf_6 incidence is nonempty on every geometric fibre. [evidence: source; Packet finding FND-0083.]\\n\\n(Total: 27 established-fact bullets; several are near-duplicates with different evidence tags.)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. ALL \\\"Frontier obligations\\\" entries\\n\\nNone. There is no section titled \\\"Frontier obligations\\\" (or equivalent) in this file.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. ALL \\\"Reusable computations\\\" with sha256\\n\\n- None recorded.\\n\\n(No sha256 values appear anywhere in this section or file.)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. ALL \\\"Candidate ideas requiring proof\\\" (verbatim)\\n\\n- For S=(St_6)_{I_6}\\u2297Q, the odd summand vanishes: S^-=0, so that (S\\u2297H^{\\u22975})_{Sp}=0.\\n- Harer virtual duality over Q: H^{vcd}(Mod_6;V) \\u2245 (St_6 \\u2297_Q V)_{Mod_6}.\\n- Exact-corner vanishing: W_{-16}H^{BM}_{16}(M_{6,6};Q)=0, equivalently W_{26}H^{26}(M_{6,6};Q)(21) is an empty direct sum of Q(8).\\n- For a smooth proper genus-6 family over a locally Noetherian characteristic-zero scheme S with six pairwise disjoint order